{"id": "t101-002", "text": "elif got a puppy!! cockapoo called biscuit, 10 wks old. she's knackered already lol", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "elif", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "puppy", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cockapoo called biscuit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "knackered", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t101-004", "text": "So I just got off the phone with Heather and um she was made redundant on Friday, the whole team basically, she's pretty shaken but she's got some savings and she said her husband's being really good about it. She's going to start looking properly in March 2027 once the payout comes through. I should check in with her next week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Heather", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made redundant", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "pretty shaken", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "start looking", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in March 2027", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "once the payout comes through", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t101-008", "text": "Theo turns 40 on 5/14. Party at his brother's. Theo said he'd love a decent bottle of whisky, Lagavulin maybe", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Theo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turns 40", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "5/14", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "brother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Theo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "love a decent bottle of whisky, Lagavulin", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t101-015", "text": "Lila's rabbit Clover died this morning. She's gutted, had her since uni. Send her something nice.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lila", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "rabbit Clover", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "since uni"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Send her something nice", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t101-016", "text": "Anya's 30th, 2 November 2026, warehouse thing in Hackney. Fancy dress, theme is 'iconic duos'. Arjun and I are going as Wallace and Gromit apparently, which means I'm the dog. Anya's sister Lila is doing the playlist and said Anya has been eyeing up a vintage record player for ages, so maybe we all chip in for that.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anya", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "30th", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "2 November 2026", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Arjun", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anya", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lila", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anya", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "eyeing up a vintage record player", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "chip in for that", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t101-020", "text": "Marcus loves rescue greyhounds, has two, Dot and Pip. Volunteers with the charity on weekends", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marcus", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "rescue greyhounds", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "has two, Dot and Pip", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Volunteers with the charity", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "weekends"}]}
{"id": "t101-021", "text": "Ok so recap from Mehmet's barbecue: Seo-yeon is pregnant, due May 14 2027, first one. Mohammed has started at the new firm and hates the commute, two hours each way. Jack's dog Rolo is turning one on June 3rd and apparently there's going to be a dog party, I'm not joking. Mehmet's wife Nora asked if I'd come to her book club. Remind me to get Seo-yeon a little something.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mehmet", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Seo-yeon", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pregnant", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "May 14 2027", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mohammed", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new firm", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates the commute, two hours each way", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "dislike"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Rolo", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turning one", "owner": "p4", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 3rd", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "e5", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dog party", "owner": "p4", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mehmet", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p6", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nora", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "book club", "owner": "p6"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get Seo-yeon a little something", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p7", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Seo-yeon", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
