{"id": "t101-029", "text": "Talked to Ines on the phone for ages. She's really struggling since her dad's funeral, not sleeping. Her sister Mila is staying with her for a bit. I need to call her again on Sunday and maybe suggest the grief group her GP mentioned.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ines", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "not sleeping", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mila", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call her again", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "suggest the grief group her GP mentioned", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "GP", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t101-030", "text": "Akira loves Studio Ghibli and is learning to make ramen from scratch", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Akira", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Studio Ghibli", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "make ramen from scratch", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t101-032", "text": "Theo hinted he wants one of those fancy pet cameras for when he's at work. His cat Nugget gets anxious", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Theo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants one of those fancy pet cameras", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "when he's at work"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Nugget", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}]}
