{"id": "t101-034", "text": "Gym at 6 then groceries. Call the landlord re boiler", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Gym", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "6", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "then", "anchor": "a2"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "groceries", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Call the landlord re boiler", "action_type": "call", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "landlord"}]}
{"id": "t101-036", "text": "Nasser invited us to his 50th, March 2027, he's booking a villa in Portugal for a long weekend. Need to sort time off", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nasser", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "50th", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "March 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "long weekend", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort time off", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t101-038", "text": "Adebayo's daughter graduates on June 3rd and they're having a garden party after. He's so proud. She did law at Leeds and already has a training contract lined up for September. His wife is doing jollof for about forty people and he says the whole family is flying in from Lagos, including his aunt who he hasn't seen since 2019.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adebayo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "graduates", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "garden party", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "proud", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "did law at Leeds", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "training contract", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "September", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying in from Lagos", "owner": "r3", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r4", "type": "RELATION", "text": "aunt", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "since 2019"}]}
{"id": "t101-039", "text": "So Caitlin's cat, the big ginger one, Marmalade, is really poorly, kidney stuff, vet says it might be time. She's taking him in Thursday to decide. She's been crying all week. I should drop round on Wednesday evening with food, and don't forget she's allergic to nuts.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Caitlin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat, the big ginger one, Marmalade", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "kidney stuff", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "taking him in", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "crying", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "all week"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop round", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday evening", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "allergic to nuts", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}]}
{"id": "t101-041", "text": "Arjun got laid off last Tuesday along with half of engineering. Already has two interviews lined up for the week of 5/14. He's weirdly upbeat about it", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Arjun", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "laid off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "two interviews", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week of 5/14", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "weirdly upbeat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t101-045", "text": "Fiona's mum's funeral is Monday 2 November 2026 at 2pm, Golders Green crematorium. Wake at the Spaniards after. Fiona asked if I could do a reading. I said yes. Need to pick one this weekend and email it to her by Friday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fiona", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday 2 November 2026 at 2pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Wake", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fiona", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "pick one", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "email it to her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Friday", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t101-047", "text": "Mehmet's dog Kebab (yes really) had to be put down yesterday. 14 years old. Mehmet's in bits, he got him the week he moved to London. His kids keep asking when Kebab is coming home. He said they might get another dog in the spring but not yet. Don't forget to send a card to the whole family, something not too soppy.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mehmet", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Kebab", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "put down", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mehmet", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in bits", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week he moved to London"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "get another dog", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send a card to the whole family", "owner": "r2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t101-051", "text": "Alejandro's brother is getting married 5/14 in Mexico City. Alejandro is best man and terrified about the speech. Ask him to send me the draft", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alejandro", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "brother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "5/14", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alejandro", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "terrified", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "speech", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask him to send me the draft", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t101-055", "text": "Elif's mum turns 70 on June 3rd 2027 and Elif wants to throw a surprise dinner. I'm on invites. Need to get the list from her sister Ines.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elif", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turns 70", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 3rd 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elif", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surprise dinner", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get the list from her sister Ines", "owner": "p3", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ines", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t101-058", "text": "Theo, or Teddy as his mates call him, said his lab Juno just had six puppies. He's keeping one", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Theo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Teddy", "pronoun": "he", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mates", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "lab Juno", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "six puppies", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
